    "chunk_size_bytes": 1583,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 20, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 26.06.2024)\n\nASSOCIATION OF HUMAN RESOURCESPROFESSIONALS (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Madhura Withanage,Attorney-at-Law, M. P. for Colombo District\n\nto incorporrate the Association of Human Resources Professionals\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Association of Human Resources Professionals(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nIncorporationof theAssociationof HumanResourcesProfessionals\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ASSOCIATION OF HUMANRESOURCES PROFESSIONALS\n\nWHEREAS a Association called and known as the\u201cAssociation of Human Resources Professionals\u201d hasheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Association according to the rulesagreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Association of HumanResources Professionals (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2024."
  },
