    "md5": "0044665d2bf7c5b66afcbb96c7656f6d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2044,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as Mahawilachchiya EducationCentre for Children (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2024.\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof theMahawilachciyaEducationCentre forChildren\n\n2Mahawilachchiya Education Centre for Children(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a\n\nVoluntary Social Services Organization within the meaning\n\nand for the purpose of the Voluntary Social Services\n\nOrganization (Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of\n\n1980 and the provisions of that Act shall apply to it and to\n\nthe management of the affairs of the body corporate.\n\n3. (1) Subject to the provisions of any written law, the\n\ngeneral objects for which the body corporate is constituted\n\nare to :\n\n(a) Conduct educational and skills development\n\nprogrammes to better equip youth to meet the needs\n\nof job opportunities of the future and acheive their\n\ngoals ;\n\n(b) Establish a traning Centre for Information\n\nTechnology (IT) - related services ;\n\n(c) Provide and/or arrange Information Technology\n\n(IT) - related services for the youth in rural areas ;\n\n(d) Conduct all such programmes as needed from time\n\nto time to enchance skills and learning ;\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objectives specified\n\nin subsection (1) body corporate shall ensure that such\n\nimplementation will be carried out without any distinction\n\nbased on race, religion, language, caste, gender, politicalopinion, place of birth or such other ground.\n\nGeneralobjects of thebodycorporate\n\nMahawilachchiya Education Centre for Children(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n4. The objectives of the body corporate shall be carriedout subject to/with the necessary approvals under applicable/the relevant written laws and in such manner as to avoid anyconflict between the work of the body corporate and of anywork being carried out simultaneously by any Ministry,Department of the Government or of any Provincial Council."
  },
