    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 05, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 09.07.2024)\n\nMEDIATION BOARDS (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs andConstitutional Reforms\n\nto amend the Mediation Boards Act, No. 72 of 1988\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 7 of the Mediation Boards Act, No. 72 of 1988(hereinafter referred to as the \"principal enactment\") and the legal effect of that sectionas amended is to enable the court of First Instance to entertain any application without thecertificate of non settlement, from any party to a dispute in respect of any offencereferred to in second Schedule of the principal enactment, if such party admits such nonsettlement before court or indicate unwillingness to resolve the matter through mediation.\n\n1Mediation Boards (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\nL.D. \u2013 O. 67/2023\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MEDIATION BOARDS ACT, NO. 72 OF 1988\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Mediation Boards(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2.Section 7 of the Mediation Boards Act, No. 72 of1988 (hereinafter referred to as the \"principal enactment\") ishereby amended in paragraph (b) of the proviso to subsection(1) thereof, by the substitution for the words \"that dispute.\"ofthe following:-\n\n\"that dispute:"
