    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 05, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 09.07.2024)\n\nLAND DEVELOPMENT (AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Mrs.) Rohini Kumari Wijerathna,M. P. for Matale District\n\nto amend the Land Development Ordinance (Chapter 464)\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Land Development (Amendment)\n\nShort title\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE LAND DEVELOPMENT ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 464)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Land Development(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 48A of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of the words \u201cor upon his or hermarriage\u201d in subsection 48A 2(c).\n\n3. Section 48B of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of subsection 48B 1(a).\n\n4. Section 68 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) of that section by the substitutionfor the words \u201cfails to succeed\u201d of the words \u201cfails withoutreasonable cause to succeed\u201d.\n\n5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentto section48A of theprincipalenactment\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\nAmendmentto section 68of theprincipalenactment\n\nAmendmentto section48B of theprincipalenactment\n\n2Land Development (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
