    "chunk_size_bytes": 1521,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 12, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 17.07.2024)\n\nTHE ASSOCIATION OF CRICKET UMPIRES,SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Association of Cricket Umpires, Sri Lanka\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Premnath C. Dolawatte,Attorney-at-Law, M.P. for Colombo District\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1The Association of Cricket Umpires,Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ASSOCIATION\n\nOF CRICKET UMPIRES, SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as\u201cThe Association of Cricket Umpires, Sri Lanka\u201d has heretoforebeen established for the purpose of effectually carrying outand transacting all matters connected with the saidAssociation, according to the rules agreed by it\u2019s members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretofore beensuccessfully carried out and transacted, the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as The Association of CricketUmpires, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 2024."
  },
