    "chunk_size_bytes": 1980,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as The Association of CricketUmpires, Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. 2024.\n\n3. The general objects for which The Corporation isestablished are hereby declared to be -\n\nShort Title\n\nIncorporationof theAssociationof CricketUmpires,Sri Lanka\n\nPreamble\n\nGeneralobjectsof theCorporation\n\n2The Association of Cricket Umpires,Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a)to protect and promote the interests, status, welfare,rights and privileges of the profession of CricketUmpires and the persons desiring to qualify asCricket Umpires;\n\n(b)to organize, supervise and control the admissionand the professional training of persons desiring toqualify as, and the grading of, Cricket Umpires;\n\n(c)to improve the standard of cricket umpiring inSri Lanka by conducting on-going training courses;\n\n(d)to regulate the general conduct and the professionalactivities of persons practicing as Cricket Umpires,in order to ensure the maintenance of highstandards in the profession;\n\n(e)to liase with the Ministry of Sports and Sri LankaCricket and with Organizations outside Sri Lanka,having allied interests and functions, to which theCorporation is affiliated;\n\n(f)to assess the eligibility of persons for admission tovarious grades of membership of the Corporation;\n\n(g)to take such other measures, including theestablishment and maintenance of data banks, asmay be necessary for the benefit and advancementof the members of the Corporation.\n\n4. (1) Subject to the provisions of sub-section (2) theadminstration, management and control of the affairs of theCorporation shall, subject to the rules of the Corporation,be vested in an Executive Committee (hereinafter referredto as \u201cThe Committee\u201d) consisting of a President, Vice\n\nManagementof the Affairsof theCorporation\n\n3The Association of Cricket Umpires,Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
  },
