    "chunk_size_bytes": 1453,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of July 26, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 29.07.2024)\n\nSRI LANKA OPTOMETRIC ASSOCIATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Sri Lanka Optometric Association\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) Kavinda HeshanJayawardhana, M. P. for Gampaha District\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\n1Sri Lanka Optometric Association(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA OPTOMETRICASSOCIATION\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the\u201cSri Lanka Optometric Association\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout its objects and transacting all matters connected withthe said Association according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka OptometricAssociation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2024."
  },
