    "chunk_size_bytes": 1982,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the KodhagodaGunarathana Nahimi Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2024.\n\nPreamble\n\nShort title\n\nIncorporationof theKodhagodaGunarathanaNahimiFoundation\n\n2Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(2) The body corporate shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of the Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the body corporate.\n\n3. The body corporate shall operates exclusively as anot-for-profit organization and it is solely for the benefit ofthe society and its members.\n\n4. (1) The general objects for which the body corporateis constituted are hereby declared to be-\n\n(a) to develop quality relationship between membersand beneficiaries of the Kodhagoda GunarathanaNahimi Foundation;\n\n(b) to develop human resources and facilitate careerdevelopment;\n\n(c) to create a religious and cultural revival of themembers of the beneficiaries of the Foundation;\n\n(d) to establish appropriate liaison between KodhagodaGunarathana Nahimi Foundation and national andinternational organizations thereby promoting moraland physical development of KodhagodaGunarathana Nahimi Foundation;\n\n(e) to bring the religious, moral, educational andphysical development to the various ethnicities ofSri Lanka;\n\nThe Generalobjects of thebodycorporate\n\nBodycorporateoperates as anot-for-profitOrganization\n\n3Kodhagoda Gunarathana Nahimi Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(f) to develop quality relationship between membersof the Foundation and it\u2019s beneficiaries;\n\n(g) to facilitate the economic and professionaldevelopment of the low income community ;\n\n(h) to work for the advancement of various local cultures;and"
  },
