    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of August 09, 2024\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 13.08.2024)\n\nSHOP AND OFFICE EMPLOYEES (REGULATION OFEMPLOYMENT AND REMUNERATION)(AMENDMENT)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. (Dr.) (Mrs.) Sudarshini Fernandopulle,M.P. for Gampaha District\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n(Private Members\u2019 Bill)\n\nto amend the Shop and Office Employees (Regulation of Employmentand Remuneration) Act (Chapter 129)\n\nShop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment)\n\n1\n\n5\n\n10\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SHOP AND OFFICE EMPLOYEES (REGULATION\n\nOF EMPLOYMENT AND REMUNERATION) ACT (CHAPTER 129)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Shop and OfficeEmployees (Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2.Section 18B of the Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration) Act(Chapter 129) is hereby amended by the insertion ofsubparagraphs (c) and (d) of the subsection (2) of that section,as follows:-\n\n\u201c(c)seven days from the date of miscarriage, if themiscarriage occurs in the first twenty eighth weeksof pregnancy; and\n\n(d)seven days from the date of termination of pregnancyunder legal or medical grounds.\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section18B ofChapter 129.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n15\n\n2Shop and Office Employees(Regulation of Employment and Remuneration)(Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
  },
