    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 290]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. (Dr.) (Mrs.) Sudarshini Fernandopulle,M.P. for Gampaha District on 21st of August, 2024\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 21, 2024)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 150.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nWw\n\nws\n\nMATERNITY BENEFITS (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Maternity Benefits Ordinance (Chapter 140)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nMaternity Benefits (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\n15\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MATERNITY BENEFITSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 140)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Maternity Benefits(Amendment) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n2. Section 3 of the Maternity Benefits Ordinance(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended by the insertion of subsection (1) (c) and (1) (d) ofthat section, as follows:-\n\n''(c) seven days from the date of miscarriage, if themiscarriage occurs in the first twenty eight weeksof pregnancy; and\n\n(d) seven days from the date of termination ofpregnancy under medical grounds''.\n\n3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof section 3of theprincipalenactment\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Maternity Benefits (Amendment)\n\nDepartment of Government Printing"
  },
