    "chunk_size_bytes": 2000,
    "chunk_text": "NOW THEREFORE, BE it in enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Local AuthoritiesElections (Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2024.\n\n(2) The Notices published under subsection (1)of section 38 of the Ordinance, in respect of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto are hereby revoked.\n\n(3) Deposits made under section 29 of theOrdinance in respect of candidates nominated by any recognized political party or an independent group for election to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto, shall notwithstanding anything to the contrary in section 30 of the Ordinance, be refunded to the person by whom the deposit was made, on the production by such person, of the receipt issued to such person under subsection (3) of section 29 of the Ordinance.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n35\n\nShort title\n\nLOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ( SPECIAL PROVISIONS) 3\n\nSinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency\n\nSteps to be commenced for holding of elections 3. Steps shall be commenced under the provisions ofthe Ordinance for the holding of elections to the Local Authorities set out in the Schedule hereto:\n\nProvided that, the notices of nominations in terms of section 26 of the Ordinance shall be published on such date as the Election Commission may determine by Order published in the Gazette and such date shall however, be a date not later than three months from the date of coming into operation of this Act.\n\n4. In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n5\n\n10\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(01) Colombo1 Colombo Municipal Council\n\n2 Dehiwala - Mt. Lavinia Municipal Council\n\n3 Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte Municipal Council\n\n4 Kaduwela Municipal Council\n\n5 Moratuwa Municipal Council\n\n6 Kollonnawa Urban Council\n\n7 Seethawakapura Urban Council\n\n8 Maharagama Urban Council\n\n9 Kesbewa Urban Council\n\n10 Boralesgamuwa Urban Council"
