    "chunk_size_bytes": 1852,
    "chunk_text": "(i) money and currency changing services; (j) issuing and managing means of payment (such as credit cards, debit cards, travelers\u2019 cheques, money orders and bankers\u2019 drafts and electronic money;)\n\n(k) issuing financial guarantees and commitments, including but not limited to consumer credit, factoring (with or without recourse) and financing of commercial transactions including forfeiting;\n\n(m) participating in securities issues and the provision of financial services related to such issues;\n\n(n) individual and collective portfolio management;\n\n(o) investing, administering or managing funds or money on behalf of other persons;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n208Proceeds of Crime\n\n(p) safekeeping and administration of cash or liquid securities on behalf of other persons;\n\n(q) safe custody services;\n\n(r) underwriting and placement of life insurance and other investment related insurance, as well as insurance intermediation by agents and brokers;\n\n(s) trustee administration or investment management of a superannuation scheme;\n\n(t) any finance business carried out under the Securities and Exchange Commission of Sri Lanka Act, No. 19 of 2021 or any Act enacted in place thereof;\n\n(u) any finance business carried out under the Local Treasury Bills Ordinance (Chapter 417) or any Act enacted in place thereof;\n\n(v) offshore units in the financial institutions in accordance with the definitions provided for the same in other written laws;\n\n(w) any person engaged in any businesses specified in paragraphs (a) to (u) of this definition which shall be registered or licensed under the Colombo Port City Economic Commission Act;\n\n(x) providing virtual assets services; and\n\n(y) such other business as may be prescribed from time to time by the Minister under section 29 of Financial Transaction Reporting Act;\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n209Proceeds of Crime"
